==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|сдать|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сда́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сдаться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сда́ться|pf|impf=сдава́ться}}

# to [[surrender]], to [[yield]]
# to [[give up]], to [[give in]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[что|Что]], [[уже|уже́]] '''сдаёшься'''?|t=What, '''give up''' already?}}
# to [[give in]], to [[give way]]
# {{lb|ru|low colloquial|in the past tense|in the following <<interrogative>> or <<negative polarity item!negative>> constructions}} to be [[necessary]], to be [[needed]] {{+obj|ru|dat<by someone>}} {{q|can be used with an interrogative, or the interrogative can be dropped, and the question can be converted into a sentence with the meaning "is not necessary", "is not needed", "screw" etc.; also, often used with {{m|ru|э́то}}}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на кой чёрт|На кой чёрт]] [[мне]] [[вообще́]] '''сдала́сь''' [[э́та]] [[рабо́та]]?|Why the hell do I even need this work?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[да|Да]] '''сда́лся''' [[тебе́]] [[э́тот]] [[Анто́н]].|Why do you need this Anton guy? / Who needs this Anton guy? / Screw this Anton guy.}}
# {{infl of|ru|сдать||pass}}

